Have you thought about writing your own recipes and always having them with you when you need them?

So that's exactly what we thought when we developed My Recipes. This app is your personal recipes cookbook, that you can manage yourself and have access to them easily when you need.

Features:
- Registration of recipes with Name, Level of Difficulty and Directions;
- Each recipe has a list of ingredients that can be ordered as needed;
- Works with iCloud, that means your recipes will be kept safe in the cloud, if you delete the app or change your device, your recipes will be displayed the way you left them.

Requirements:
- The device must have an iCloud account associated with your account;
- Internet access to keep the recipes synchronized.
